-----------------------\n241:   OVS Version               \"3.3.4-62.el9fdp\"\n242:   DB Version                \"8.5.0\"\n243:   System Type               rhcos\n244:   System Version            \"4.16\"\n245:   DPDK Initialized          false\n246:   Datapath Types            [netdev, system]\n247: \n248:   External IDs:\n249:     hostname: master2.example.com\n250:     ovn-encap-ip: 10.32.110.5\n251:     ovn-encap-type: geneve\n252: \n253: ================================================================================\n254: OVS TOPOLOGY\n255: ================================================================================\n256: \n257:   System UUID: 7e9a3f70-86fa-4578-a849-4fd807a64a10\n258:   Total Bridges: 2\n259: \n260:   Bridge: br-ex\n261:     ports: 3\n262:       internal: br-ex\n263:       patch: patch-br-ex-to-br-int\n264:       system: nm-bond\n265: \n266:   Bridge: br-int\n267:     fail_mode: secure\n268:     datapath_type: system\n269:     ports: 12\n270:       geneve: 9 ports\n271:       internal: ovn-k8s-mp0, br-int\n272:       patch: patch-br-int-to-br-ex\n273: \n274: ================================================================================\n275: OPENFLOW ANALYSIS\n276: ================================================================================\n277: \n278:   Bridge: br-int\n279:   ----------------------------------------------------------------------\n280:   Total flows: 2,017\n281:   Flows with hits: 318\n282:   Drop flows: 150 (9 actively dropping)\n283: \n284:   ⚠️  ACTIVE DROP FLOWS (9):\n285:     table=40, priority=0, packets=8,105\n286:     table=79, priority=100, packets=1,356\n287:       match: ip,reg14=0x2,metadata=0x5,dl_src=00:62:0b:ea:b5:e0\n288: \n289: --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n290: DATAPATH FLOW TABLE HEALTH\n291: --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n292: \n293:   Current flows: 155 / 200,000 (0.1% used)\n294:   Average: 1